<title>RUSSIA: TENNIS-IVANISEVIC BEATS KAFELNIKOV FOR KREMLIN CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-IVANISEVIC BEATS KAFELNIKOV FOR KREMLIN CUP.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the final of the Kremlin Cup men's tennis tournament on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>2-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) beat 1-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) 3-6 6-1 6-3</p>
